Community port of Microsoft ProcMon-Linux for native FreeBSD 15.1 amd64.
Uses the base DTrace syscall provider and CTF metadata, with a curses interface,
PID/syscall filters, typed arguments, bounded snapshots, user symbols, statistics,
private SQLite capture and replay. Requires tracing privileges for live capture.
FreeBSD and Linux trace files use distinct formats. Other releases, ABIs and
sustained production workloads require further validation.
